{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>如果你曾為作業、合約或票據的照片不夠清晰平整而煩惱，那麼這款輕巧的行動應用 AlignScan 將是你的理想選擇。它能將你隨手拍下的文件照片，智能轉換為清晰、整潔且具有專業水準的檔案，無論是學術提交、商務報告還是個人資料存檔，都能完美應對，現在更是限時免費下載，千萬別錯過。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-46.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>智能自動化處理，文件掃描輕而易舉</h2>\n    <p>AlignScan 擁有多項實用功能，能夠自動辨識文件有效區域並精準裁邊，同時透過透視校正功能修正頁面的傾斜與變形，確保影像端正。它還能智慧增強圖像品質，有效減少陰影、提升文字亮度，讓文件內容清晰易讀。更令人安心的是，所有核心掃描與優化步驟均在裝置本機完成，全面保護你的隱私安全。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-88-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-89-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-90-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-91-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-92-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-93-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：AlignScan – 智慧掃描排版</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-10T22:08:47.234065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}